  "content": "<style>\n    :root {\n        --brand-black: #000000;\n        --brand-red: #e2214b;\n        --text-dark: #1a1a1a;\n        --text-light: #666666;\n    }\n    .title {\n        display: none;\n    }\n\n    body {\n        font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n        color: var(--text-dark);\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 1100px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    /* TYPOGRAPHY */\n    .page-title {\n        font-weight: 800;\n        font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);\n        line-height: 1.1;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 2em 0 1em;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: -1px;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n        font-weight: 700;\n        font-size: 24px;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-red);\n        padding-left: 15px;\n        line-height: 1;\n    }\n\n    .intro-text {\n        font-size: 1.1rem;\n        color: var(--text-light);\n        max-width: 800px;\n        margin: 0 auto 3em;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .p {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n        color: #444;\n    }\n\n    /* GRID LAYOUTS */\n    .specs-grid {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n        gap: 40px;\n        margin-bottom: 60px;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    /* CARDS */\n    .spec-card {\n        background: #f9f9f9;\n        padding: 30px;\n        border: 1px solid #eee;\n    }\n\n    .spec-card h4 {\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        margin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    /* IMAGES */\n    .feature-img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: auto;\n        display: block;\n        filter: contrast(1.1);\n    }\n    \n    .hero-img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 400px;\n        object-fit: cover;\n        margin-bottom: 2em;\n        filter: brightness(0.9);\n    }\n\n    /* COMPARISON LINK BLOCK */\n    .comparison-banner {\n        background: var(--brand-black);\n        color: white;\n        padding: 40px;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 40px 0;\n    }\n\n    .comparison-banner h3 {\n        font-size: 24px;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .comparison-link {\n        color: white;\n        text-decoration: underline;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n        transition: color 0.2s;\n    }\n    \n    .comparison-link:hover {\n        color: var(--brand-red);\n    }\n\n    /* PRO TIP BOX (FIXED VISIBILITY) */\n    .pro-tip-box {\n        background: #ffffff;\n        border-left: 5px solid var(--brand-red); \n        border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        border-right: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        padding: 25px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #333;\n        margin-top: 40px;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n        line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    /* CTA SECTION (FIXED FLEX LAYOUT) */\n    .cta-section {\n        background: #f4f4f4;\n        padding: 60px 20px;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-top: 60px;\n    }\n\n    .cta-grid {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        gap: 20px;\n        max-width: 600px;\n        margin: 30px auto 0;\n    }\n\n    .cta-grid a {\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .btn {\n        display: inline-block;\n        padding: 18px 30px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        transition: all 0.2s;\n        border: none;\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .btn-primary {\n        background: var(--brand-red);\n        color: white;\n    }\n    \n    .btn-primary:hover {\n        background: #b01235;\n    }\n\n    /* INVERTED BUTTON STYLE */\n    .btn-inverse {\n        background: var(--brand-black);\n        border: 2px solid var(--brand-black);\n        color: white;\n    }\n\n    .btn-inverse:hover {\n        background: transparent;\n        color: var(--brand-black);\n    }\n\n    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {\n        .cta-grid {\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n        .hero-img {\n            height: 250px;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/47711/cart/resources/20230615/8289e614bb46451ae5008995f8d7efaa.jpg\" class=\"hero-img\" alt=\"MOMUTO Custom Football Kit Production\" />\n<h1 class=\"page-title\">Technology &amp; Materials: Engineering Pro-Grade Soccer Kits</h1>\n<p class=\"intro-text\">We don't just print shirts; we engineer performance. By combining high-GSM interlock fabrics with next-gen sublimation, we create kits that rival the \"Pro-Versions\" of major brands.</p>\n<div class=\"specs-grid\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">The MOMUTO Pro-Lock Fabric Technology</h2>\n<p class=\"p\">Most custom competitors use cheap, 100% rigid polyester. <strong>We do it differently.</strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\">Our signature blend incorporates <strong>Elastane fibers</strong> directly into the polyester weave. This creates a \"4-way stretch\" that moves with the athlete, preventing the boxy, heavy feel of standard teamwear.</p>\n<div class=\"spec-card\">\n<h4>Fabric Specs:</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;\">\n<li><strong>✓ Micro-Interlock:</strong> Maximum durability, zero transparency.</li>\n<li><strong>✓ Moisture Wicking:</strong> Draws sweat rapidly away from the skin.</li>\n<li><strong>✓ 145-160 GSM:</strong> The perfect weight balance for 90 minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/pages/momuto-vs-jersix-owayo-spized-comparison\" style=\"color: var(--brand-red); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\"> SEE HOW WE COMPARE VS OTHER BRANDS &rarr; </a></p>\n</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/47711/cart/resources/20230615/f3d40941307a89032b5eeaa404ac9dea.jpg\" class=\"feature-img\" alt=\"Fabric Texture Detail\" /></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"comparison-banner\">\n<h3>Not All Custom Kits Are Equal</h3>\n<p style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\">See the side-by-side breakdown of why MOMUTO materials outlast vinyl-printed teamwear.</p>\n<a href=\"/pages/momuto-vs-jersix-owayo-spized-comparison\" class=\"comparison-link\">View The Comparison Chart</a></div>\n<div class=\"specs-grid\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">\n<div style=\"direction: ltr;\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">HD Sublimation &amp; Pro Details</h2>\n<p class=\"p\"><strong>Standard Precision:</strong> All MOMUTO kits come standard with <strong>100% HD Sublimation</strong>. We infuse the ink directly into the fabric at 200&deg;C, ensuring the design is weightless, breathable, and never peels.</p>\n<p class=\"p\"><strong>The \"Player Version\" Upgrade (Optional):</strong><br />For larger club orders, we offer the option to upgrade to <strong>3D Silicone</strong> or <strong>Rubberized Crests</strong>. This premium finish adds texture and depth, mirroring exactly what professional players wear on match day.<br /><em style=\"font-size: 0.9em; color: #666;\">*Note: Due to mold production costs, 3D Silicone is available for bulk orders only.</em></p>\n</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/ec4456c71a76fe747fba4eed14fe312f15d207c4ea7c3816cd756a4fad4ed6b1.png\" class=\"feature-img\" alt=\"3D Silicone Logo\" /></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro-tip-box\"><strong style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.1em;\">💡 Pro-Tip for Longevity:</strong> Machine wash cold (30&deg;C). Do not use fabric softener. Air dry only (no tumble dry). Never iron directly on 3D crests.</div>\n<div class=\"cta-section\">\n<h2 style=\"text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Ready to create?</h2>\n<p>Choose your path to the perfect kit.</p>\n<div class=\"cta-grid\"><a href=\"/pages/3d-designer\" class=\"btn btn-primary\"> Launch 3D Tool </a> <a href=\"/pages/free-design-request\" class=\"btn btn-inverse\"> Request Free Design </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What fabric does MOMUTO use for custom soccer kits?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We use our signature Pro-Lock™ fabric blend, a 145-160 GSM micro-interlock polyester with elastane fibers for 4-way stretch and moisture-wicking performance.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does MOMUTO use sublimation printing?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, we use 100% deep-dye HD sublimation at 200°C. This ensures designs are breathable, weightless, and never crack or peel, unlike traditional vinyl printing.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
